{"title": "Motorola accidentally confirms its ‘Razr Flex’ wide foldable is coming in 2027", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/09/motorola-razr-flex-wide-foldable-2027-leak/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/09/Motorola-Razr-wide-teaser.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1400\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Following a past teaser, Motorola has mistakenly posted an early support page that not only confirms the name of its wide foldable as the “Razr Flex,” but also confirms it will be launching in 2027.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/09/motorola-razr-flex-wide-foldable-2027-leak/#more-736057\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-09T06:50:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-10T17:38:42.816641+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
